      "kind": "body",
      "text": "injury table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,732,750]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 Facial scar. You have a permanent -1 to your Charisma rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,750,813]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2 Impaired arm. You have a permanent -1 to your Attack rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,813,874]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with hand-to-hand weapons.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,874,901]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3 Eye damage. You have a  permanent -1 to your ranged Attack\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,901,962]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,962,969]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4 Limping. You have a permanent -1 on all Escape rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,969,1025]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5 Brain damage. You have a permanent -1 to all Will and Magic\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,1025,1087]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,1087,1094]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,1094,1096]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Crippled arm. You lose the use of one arm. You may no\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,1096,1150]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "longer use weapons that require two hands. You may still\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,1150,1207]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-injury-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "use rifles and shotguns with a -1 penalty.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,1207,1249]]"
    }
  ],
